<title>USA: GTE offers 3 flat-rate plans for business.</title>
<headline>GTE offers 3 flat-rate plans for business.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTE Corp said Wednesday it would offer three new long-distance flat-rate calling plans for business:</p>
<p>-- rates as low as $0.14 per minute with a minimum monthly usage requirement of $10.</p>
<p>-- rates as low as $0.15 per minute, depending on term commitment.</p>
<p>-- an international plan offering a flat price per minute depending on which country is called.</p>
<p>GTE said its long-distance service is now available in all 50 U.S. states.</p>
</text>
